  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_1232_SR227_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Buck: Yo, if it isn’t {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r",
        "Don’t tell me you’re going to Stark\n",
        "Mountain, too?\r",
        "You’re pretty wimpy...\n",
        "You’re sure you’re going to be OK?\r",
        "Heh, why am I asking you that?\n",
        "It’s not like I care.\r",
        "Anyways, if we see each other on\n",
        "Stark Mountain, the race is on to\\fsee who gets the Magma Stone first!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1232_SR227_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Wake: Oh, if it isn’t {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "It’s been a while!\r",
        "You’ve grown so tough that you’re\n",
        "training out here now...\r",
        "Everyone keeps getting tougher and\n",
        "tougher...\r",
        "And, in doing that, they develop\n",
        "closer bonds with their Pokémon...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1232_SR227_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}: ...For someone born\n",
        "overseas, that tough dude doesn’t\\fhave an accent or anything.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1232_SR227_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, there’s a volcano\n",
        "ahead of us called Stark Mountain.\r",
        "That blowhard Buck guy is on his way\n",
        "there, as well.\r",
        "I’m going to find the volcano’s\n",
        "treasure before that guy does.\r",
        "If I could do that, a 21-win streak\n",
        "at the Battle Tower’d be possible!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1232_SR227_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Wake: ...You’re serious?\n",
        "You’re going to Stark Mountain?\r",
        "Even the wild Pokémon there are\n",
        "very, very tough...\r",
        "If your Pokémon aren’t well trained,\n",
        "they’ll have a miserable time...\r",
        "Then again, that kind of challenge\n",
        "is an exciting prospect...\r",
        "But no matter what, you’d better\n",
        "be fully prepared!\r",
        "I’ve got to get ready for another\n",
        "tournament. Farewell!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_1232_SR227_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Rt. 227\n",
        "Stark Mountain"
      ]
    },
